        {
          "ask": "Coloured rectangles have been drawn around parts of this picture, and two thick red bars have been drawn just outside two of them. Does each coloured rectangle enclose one of the drawings on the sheet? Answer yes or no only.",
          "image": "ovm5.path",
          "out": "q"
        },
        {
          "fail_if": ["q.unreadable"]
